    <td style="text-align: justify; vertical-align: bottom; width: 85%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Exclusive license and sublicense agreements with CLS Therapeutics Ltd. (&#8220;CLS&#8221;) to develop its interventional DNase technology, which is aimed at improving outcomes of existing treatments, including immunotherapies;</span></td></tr>
