    <td><span style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</span></td>
    <td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the applicant consents to a second orphan medicinal product application; or</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td>&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
