on Operations</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">The short and long-term implications
of geopolitical events and global conflicts, including those in Ukraine and the Middle East are difficult to predict at this time. The
imposition of current and future sanctions and counter sanctions may have an adverse effect on the economic markets generally and could
impact the Company&#8217;s business, financial condition, and results of operations.</p>

