    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">Collaborative partners performing research and development and pre-clinical
    activities;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">Program managers in connection with overall program management of exploratory
    studies and clinical trials;</p></td></tr>
