<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Leases</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company determines whether an arrangement is a
lease at inception. The Company leases office space in a shared office location in Framingham, Massachusetts. As this lease had a term
of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract_iI_dtM_c20251231__us-gaap--PropertySubjectToOrAvailableForOperatingLeaseAxis__custom--OfficeSpaceMember_zhy96m4Ic7S6" title="Lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_OfficeSpaceMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" id="Fact001162" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract">6</ix:nonNumeric></span> months at inception, the Company did not apply the provisions of ASU 2016-02 and will account for it as an operating lease. As of
December 31, 2025, total minimum lease payments on this lease were approximately $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityPaymentsDue_iI_pp0p0_c20251231__us-gaap--PropertySubjectToOrAvailableForOperatingLeaseAxis__custom--OfficeSpaceMember_z2Mfs2sJdX86" title="Future minimum rental payments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityPaymentsDue" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_OfficeSpaceMember" id="Fact001164" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">7,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, representing a 6 month extension effective from
January 1, 2026 through June 30, 2026.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Letter of Credit</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">As of December 31, 2025, the Company has an outstanding
letter of credit of approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--LettersOfCreditOutstandingAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20251231_zy3EcH8RGf1c" title="Outstanding letter of credit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LettersOfCreditOutstandingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact001166" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million in support of an intercompany loan with its Hesperix subsidiary. As the intercompany loan
is eliminated in consolidation, the letter of credit has no effect on the consolidated financial statements.</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001168" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_804_eus-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsDisclosureTextBlock_zSEYy8tD6Vl3" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;&#160;</p>

